#a6d189\">{ \"city\": \"深圳\", \"temp\": 31 }</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--code-muted)\">返回是 JSON，先看清结构再取</span></div>","api-key-leak":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"background:#1d2129;border-color:#1d2129\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:monospace;color:#f38ba8\">const key = \"sk-live-8f2k…\"</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#f38ba8\">前端代码可见，密钥会泄露</span></div>","api-no-status":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-tag red\">404</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">仍按成功数据处理</span></div></div>","api-raw-error":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span class=\"mk-toast\"><i class=\"mk-dot red\"></i>AxiosError: ECONNREFUSED</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">缺少用户能够理解和执行的说明</span></div>","api-spam":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-tag orange\">429</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">频繁重复请求，触发限流</span></div></div>"}}}